rooms_desc ({0,"You are in the local village church. The church has the service of revivingghosts. Dead people come to church and pray. There is a huge pit in thecenter. An archway leads to another chamber through the west wall, back on thenorth wall is an entrance to the Wedding Chapel of Illuvatar.  In the eastwall you notice the entrance to a small side room, the church portal opens tothe south. You feel the peace and holiness of this place and you are sure thegods would punish the sacrilege of shedding blood here.","You are standing in a beautiful chapel. Light streams in through the delicatestained glass windows, flooding the chapel in brightness and colour. Above youyou can see the chapel organ, with its intricately embossed piping. There arelots of seats here, where people sit for services and wedding ceremonies.","This is a side room, containing a kind of elevator to move you up and down.There is a shaft leading upward and downward to the west.","Everything is silent here. The only sound you hear comes fromfrom the robe of the father, as he pages through the bible,praying. Pray, pilgrim, pray for the mercy of god!","You are standing in a small passage of the church. This roomis completely empty, except for a door to the north.You get the feeling that this room was used as an altar roomto pray for the dead in former times.",0,0,0,0,})
